.TH CORTEX 1 "2026" "cortex-memory" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cortex \- three-layer semantic memory system for AI assistants
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cortex
[\fB\-\-config\fR \fIpath\fR]
[\fB\-\-log\-level\fR \fIlevel\fR]
\fIcommand\fR [\fIargs\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBcortex\fR is a three-layer semantic memory system for AI assistants.
It stores, organises, and retrieves developer knowledge using vector embeddings
and cosine-similarity search, organised into three lifecycle layers:
.PP
.RS 4
.IP working
Session-scoped temporary context.
.IP episodic
Time-bound events and decisions (retained for 90 days by default).
.IP semantic
Permanent, reusable knowledge and conventions.
.RE
.PP
Memories are embedded via Ollama (default model: \fInomic\-embed\-text\fR) and
stored in a ChromaDB database in the project-local \fI.agents/cortex\fR directory.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config " path"
Path to configuration file (default: \fI.agents/cortex/config.yaml\fR).
.TP
.BI \-\-log\-level " level"
Log level: debug, info, warning, error (default: info).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B create
Create a new memory with title, content, and metadata.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-t ", " \-\-title " string"
Memory title (3\(en60 characters). Derived from content if omitted.
.TP
.BI \-c ", " \-\-content " string"
Memory content (required, minimum 10 characters, Markdown supported).
.TP
.BI \-l ", " \-\-level " level"
Memory level: working, episodic, semantic (default: episodic).
.TP
.BI \-\-tags " tags"
Comma-separated tags.
.TP
.BI \-\-session " id"
Session ID (required for working level; auto-derived from git branch if omitted).
.TP
.BI \-\-source " source"
Origin source: manual, auto, llm (default: manual).
.TP
.BI \-\-task\-id " id"
Associated task or ticket identifier.
.TP
.BI \-\-author " string"
Author identifier.
.TP
.BI \-\-git\-branch " branch"
Git branch at creation time (auto-detected from current repository if omitted).
.TP
.BI \-\-agent\-name " name"
Name of the agent creating this memory.
.TP
.BI \-\-agent\-session " id"
Agent session identifier.
.TP
.BI \-\-user\-prompt " text"
User prompt that triggered creation of this memory.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output result as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B search \fIquery\fR
Search memories using semantic (cosine) similarity.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-n ", " \-\-top " int"
Maximum number of results (default: 5).
.TP
.BI \-\-min\-score " float"
Minimum similarity score, 0.0\(en1.0 (default: 0.5).
.TP
.BI \-l ", " \-\-level " level"
Filter by memory level: working, episodic, semantic.
.TP
.BI \-\-session " id"
Filter working memories by session ID.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-obsolete
Include obsolete (soft-deleted) memories.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output results as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B list
List memories with optional filtering.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-l ", " \-\-level " level"
Filter by memory level.
.TP
.BI \-\-session " id"
Filter working memories by session ID.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-obsolete
Include obsolete memories.
.TP
.BI \-\-limit " int"
Maximum results (0 = unlimited).
.TP
.BI \-\-offset " int"
Number of results to skip.
.TP
.B \-\-reverse
Reverse sort order (oldest first).
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B get \fIid\fR
Retrieve a specific memory by ID or unique ID prefix.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B delete \fIid\fR
Permanently delete a memory by ID.
.RS
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-force
Skip confirmation prompt.
.RE
.TP
.B consolidate \fIcontent\fR
Create a memory or merge with a semantically similar existing one.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-l ", " \-\-level " level"
Target memory level (default: semantic).
.TP
.BI \-t ", " \-\-title " string"
Memory title (derived from content if omitted).
.TP
.BI \-\-tags " tags"
Comma-separated tags.
.TP
.BI \-\-session " id"
Session ID (auto-derived from git branch if omitted).
.TP
.BI \-\-source " source"
Source: manual, auto, llm (default: manual).
.TP
.BI \-\-task\-id " id"
Associated task/ticket ID.
.TP
.BI \-\-author " string"
Author identifier.
.TP
.BI \-\-git\-branch " branch"
Git branch (auto-detected if omitted).
.TP
.BI \-\-agent\-name " name"
Agent name.
.TP
.BI \-\-agent\-session " id"
Agent session ID.
.TP
.BI \-\-user\-prompt " text"
User prompt that triggered consolidation.
.TP
.B \-\-force
Skip duplicate detection; always create a new memory.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B transfer\-working
Transfer all working memories for a session to the episodic layer.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-\-session " id"
Session ID to transfer (auto-derived from git branch if omitted).
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B autoprune
Remove duplicates, archive old episodic memories, and merge similar semantic memories.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-\-duplicates\-threshold " float"
Similarity threshold for duplicate removal (default: 0.92).
.TP
.BI \-\-retention\-days " int"
Episodic retention period in days (default: 90).
.TP
.BI \-\-merge\-threshold " float"
Similarity threshold for semantic memory merging (default: 0.88).
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Preview changes without modifying storage.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B export
Export memories to JSON or Markdown format.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-o ", " \-\-output " path"
Output directory or file path.
.TP
.B \-\-all
Export all memories.
.TP
.BI \-\-level " level"
Filter by memory level.
.TP
.BI \-\-intent " string"
Export a synthesis document based on semantic search.
.TP
.BI \-f ", " \-\-format " format"
Export format: json, markdown (default: json).
.RE
.TP
.B import \fIfiles...\fR
Import memories from JSON or Markdown files.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-force
Overwrite existing memories.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Validate without importing.
.TP
.BI \-f ", " \-\-format " format"
File format: json, markdown (auto-detected if omitted).
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output result as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B stats
Display database metrics and storage statistics.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as JSON.
.RE
.TP
.B config
View and manage configuration.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-\-output " format"
Output format: yaml, json, text (default: yaml).
.TP
.B init
Create default configuration file at \fI.agents/cortex/config.yaml\fR.
.TP
.B path
Show path to the active configuration file.
.TP
.BI "get " \fIkey\fR
Get a specific configuration value by dot-separated key.
.RE
.TP
.B session
Print the session ID derived from the current git branch.
.TP
.B start\-mcp\-server
Start the Cortex MCP server for AI assistant integration.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-\-transport " mode"
Transport mode: stdio, sse (default: stdio).
.TP
.BI \-\-address " addr"
Server address for SSE transport (default: :8080).
.RE
.TP
.B completion \fIshell\fR
Generate shell completion scripts for bash, zsh, fish, or powershell.
.TP
.B install\-man
Install the cortex man page to the system.
.RS
.TP
.BI \-\-prefix " path"
Installation prefix (default: /usr/local).
The man page is installed to \fI<prefix>/share/man/man1/cortex.1\fR.
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CORTEX_STORAGE_PATH
Storage directory path (default: \fI.agents/cortex\fR).
.TP
.B CORTEX_EMBEDDINGS_ENDPOINT
Ollama API endpoint (default: \fIhttp://localhost:11434\fR).
.TP
.B CORTEX_EMBEDDINGS_MODEL
Ollama embedding model (default: \fInomic\-embed\-text\fR).
.TP
.B CORTEX_EMBEDDINGS_TIMEOUT
Ollama request timeout in seconds (default: 30).
.TP
.B CORTEX_SEARCH_TOP_K
Default number of search results (default: 5).
.TP
.B CORTEX_SEARCH_MIN_SCORE
Minimum similarity score for search (default: 0.5).
.TP
.B CORTEX_CONSOLIDATION_SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD
Deduplication threshold for consolidation (default: 0.85).
.TP
.B CORTEX_AUTOPRUNE_DUPLICATES_THRESHOLD
Similarity threshold for autoprune duplicate removal (default: 0.92).
.TP
.B CORTEX_AUTOPRUNE_EPISODIC_RETENTION_DAYS
Episodic memory retention period in days (default: 90).
.TP
.B CORTEX_AUTOPRUNE_SEMANTIC_MERGE_THRESHOLD
Similarity threshold for semantic memory merging (default: 0.88).
.TP
.B CORTEX_SESSION_AUTO_DERIVE
Auto-derive session ID from git branch (default: true).
.TP
.B CORTEX_SESSION_MAX_SEGMENTS
Number of git branch segments to use (default: 2).
.SH EXAMPLES
Create a semantic memory:
.PP
.RS
.nf
cortex create \-\-title "Context timeout pattern" \-\-level semantic \e
  \-\-content "Always set a timeout on external calls." \-\-tags "pattern,best-practice"
.fi
.RE
.PP
Search for relevant memories:
.PP
.RS
.nf
cortex search "database connection timeout"
.fi
.RE
.PP
List all episodic memories:
.PP
.RS
.nf
cortex list \-\-level episodic \-\-json
.fi
.RE
.PP
Consolidate a learning into semantic memory (deduplicates automatically):
.PP
.RS
.nf
cortex consolidate "Use exponential backoff for retry logic." \-\-level semantic
.fi
.RE
.PP
Transfer working memories to episodic at session end:
.PP
.RS
.nf
cortex transfer\-working
.fi
.RE
.PP
Start the MCP server for Claude Code or Cursor integration:
.PP
.RS
.nf
cortex start\-mcp\-server \-\-transport stdio
.fi
.RE
.PP
Show database statistics as JSON:
.PP
.RS
.nf
cortex stats \-\-json
.fi
.RE
.PP
Generate shell completions (bash):
.PP
.RS
.nf
cortex completion bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/cortex
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I .agents/cortex/config.yaml
Project-local configuration file.
.TP
.I .agents/cortex/chroma.sqlite3
ChromaDB persistence file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ollama (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Written by the Cortex contributors.
